id: pm-memory-recall-freshness
title: Report stale or contradictory knowledge in task recall
description: "Reuse existing verification and supersession signals to expose bounded, checkable freshness and contradiction evidence during task recall."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-11-19T06:08:31.207Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-21T03:06:42.360Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Agents can recover source evidence for a disclosed conflict without reading every candidate.
parent: pm-memory-0kwy
comments[58]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-19T14:01:30.994Z",codex-sol,"Design: expose evidence through an opt-in SDK resume intent. Use a certified same-tracker snapshot, persist no recall exposure, keep complete rows within the existing ceiling, and report omitted rows and conflict evidence. Reuse native verification and supersession; disclose a single-field source only when it can adjudicate the competing guidance."
  "2026-11-19T14:11:40.400Z",codex-sol,"Scratch copy of the public tracker, with public facts and a synthetic recorded contradiction: resume plus both status, updated_at and dependencies reads took 262 TOON tokens (100 + 69 + 93). Resume-evidence plus the named dependencies read took 233 (155 + 78), saving 29 tokens and one read. The dependencies-only baseline with native ids supplied tied at 233. Counts use the SDK UTF-8 byte estimator."
  "2026-11-19T14:20:58.607Z",codex-sol,The pinned SDK stores a forward supersedes relationship. Resume-evidence derives the incoming superseded side and identifies the item that owns the edge. Explicit opposing guidance can use a persisted stale reason. Reciprocal edges and opposing guidance without a decisive source produce a conflict_sources receipt. Local targeted recall tests passed; the legacy missing-field branch has a dedicated fixture under verification.
  "2026-11-19T14:46:40.418Z",codex-sol,"Stock origin/main and candidate resume output matched byte-for-byte on the scratch tracker. Reading the conflict-returned source and field reproduced the named projection. Direct npm run test:install hit the 30-minute install.acceptance.ts file watchdog during the packed Bun fixture. Reference-suffix consumers and shipped-files checks passed. The unchanged install suite is running with PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3."
  "2026-11-19T15:05:07.616Z",codex-sol,"Implementation 3750d2ba92fcb8af2bedd74dd462143ad8f5945d. Typecheck, lint, identity, duplication, docstrings and regenerated changelog check passed. All four recall cases passed with 100% statements, branches, functions and lines for src/task-recall.ts. PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3 npm run test:install passed all four packed npm/Bun and publishing-file checks. The full quick coverage command reported a failure in the existing 1 MiB policy-framing case. That case passed on stock main and this branch in isolation, and again on this branch with V8 coverage instrumentation. The full local run is still collecting results; exact-head GitHub checks are pending."
  "2026-11-19T19:27:46.511Z",codex-sol,"Round EB investigates CodeRabbit thread PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc65mhxy. Trace content and native write paths, reproduce stale verification through real tracker writes, and run the requested gates."
  "2026-11-19T19:30:20.119Z",codex-sol,"Verified the reported native body edit with a real CLI and tracker. The content edit invalidated verification in one history entry, while pm update --body retained the prior content timestamp. The SDK mutation guard receives snapshots, so invalidation must be included in the native update options before admission."
  "2026-11-19T19:36:36.356Z",codex-sol,The CLI prepares native guidance invalidation before dispatch. The locked mutation guard checks that verification fields were cleared and the content clock advanced. Guarded and standalone SDK publication share the revision helper. Recall also checks persisted history for legacy and extension-free writes.
  "2026-11-19T19:43:01.320Z",codex-sol,"A clean archive of 14726bf reproduced the full report: a real pm update --body persisted changed guidance, kept both verification clocks, and task recall still returned fresh. The regression now checks persisted fields, one history entry, and the recall verdict for each edit path."
  "2026-11-19T19:44:35.656Z",codex-sol,"CodeRabbit thread PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc65mhxy on pm-memory#87 maps to 3ec0e45a45ac5a8a2c087226060872fd056b6728. The implementation advances the content clock and clears verification in the update itself. Real content, CLI body and title, and standalone and injected host edits all produce unverified recall. Typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings, and changelog check passed. Full quick coverage is running."
  "2026-11-19T19:53:24.831Z",codex-sol,Follow-up pm-memory-native-input-revision tracks two confirmed native input limits. Bulk body edits and document edits that echo prior verification fields currently refuse without persisting changed guidance.
  "2026-11-19T20:47:25.906Z",codex-sol,The full suite exposed a recovery test whose in-process peer shared the newly active admission guard. The fixture now uses the existing independent SDK writer process for both peer writes and retains the post-no-op dependency assertions. The focused recovery case passed.
  "2026-11-19T21:19:40.464Z",codex-sol,The first full quick run completed with 922 of 923 tests passing and 99.97% branch coverage. Its only test failure and uncovered branch were the portable recovery no-op case corrected in d85c6ba3549449fabc47d2802a59f58768d4e9f3. The corrected case passed with V8 instrumentation and reached the formerly uncovered branch. The full quick command is running on the corrected commit.
  "2026-11-19T21:46:59.406Z",codex-sol,"Full quick coverage passed on d85c6ba3549449fabc47d2802a59f58768d4e9f3 with 923 passing tests, zero failures or skips, and 100% statements, branches, functions and lines across 40 source files. The linked recall, content and host command passed all 28 tests. The shipped-file check, typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings, identity and changelog checks passed. CodeRabbit thread PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc65mhxy maps to implementation commit 3ec0e45a45ac5a8a2c087226060872fd056b6728."
  "2026-11-20T00:59:25.455Z",codex-sol,"Round EI verified both CodeRabbit threads are open on 6158dac. Reproduce each through a real tracker, compare tags using native update semantics, and ensure later guidance edits take precedence over create-entry verification."
  "2026-11-20T01:01:37.767Z",codex-sol,"Both real-tracker regressions failed on the review head. Equivalent replacement tags cleared the verification fields, and an extension-free title edit left imported guidance fresh. Native tag replacement canonicalizes values by trimming, lowercasing, deduplicating, and sorting before persistence."
  "2026-11-20T01:04:05.505Z",codex-sol,"Round EI thread mapping. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc65vv4T maps to e75ced4, which preserves verification for equivalent native tag replacements and clears it in the same history entry when tags change. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc65vv4Z maps to e75ced4, which keeps unchanged verified imports fresh and rejects create-time verification after a later guidance edit. The regressions use real trackers."
  "2026-11-20T01:09:30.739Z",codex-sol,"The tag replacement regression confirmed the persisted field values. Its atomicity assertion now accepts the native item-field path for array element patches, while requiring the tags and verification fields in the same history entry."
  "2026-11-20T01:41:45.856Z",codex-sol,"The focused run passed 24 tests, native-host passed 12, and typecheck, lint, and changelog check passed. The first full quick coverage run reported a failure in the existing 1 MiB policy framing test. The isolated direct test passed. Awaiting the full failure details and a coverage-instrumented isolation run before deciding on the retry."
  "2026-11-20T02:35:53.772Z",codex-sol,Stopped the first full quick run after two failures. The 1 MiB framing case reported extension_mutation_guard_timed_out for pm-memory-forward-base before create and passed in isolation with and without V8 instrumentation. Follow-up pm-memory-forward-guard-timeout records that separate failure. The portable-forward file hit its 30-minute watchdog. Retrying the same coverage command with PM_TEST_FILE_TIMEOUT_MS=3600000 and the same assertions and thresholds.
  "2026-11-20T04:41:52.928Z",codex-sol,"Round EI validation passed on the source and test changes through 7ccc351. Typecheck and lint passed. The focused recall, content, and direct-reference command passed 24 tests, and the native-host command passed 12. The coverage retry with PM_TEST_FILE_TIMEOUT_MS=3600000, PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick, and PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3 passed 924 tests with zero failures, cancellations, or skips and 100 percent statements, branches, functions, and lines across 40 source files. Changelog regeneration and check passed. The policy guard timeout remains tracked in pm-memory-forward-guard-timeout."
  "2026-11-20T06:28:49.948Z",codex-sol,"Round ES addresses all four PR review findings. Preserve verification for equivalent field values, prepare each bulk update and persisted full-document fields in the native mutation, and compute conflict evidence from each requested prefix. Verify with real trackers and the package gates."
  "2026-11-20T06:56:25.137Z",codex-sol,"The real tracker showed that replacing built-in command handlers emits ownership warnings before even unrelated JSON refusals. The revised integration uses parser and command-result extension services around native no-op and preview paths, and leaves the locked mutation guard active. Focused tests confirm bulk apply and rollback, persisted full-document normalization, no-op field updates, and shrinking recall projections."
  "2026-11-20T07:09:20.597Z",codex-sol,"Round ES maps PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc652ONn to b355136 for equivalent field comparison, PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc652ONs to b355136 for per-memory bulk preparation, PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc652ON3 to b355136 for persisted full-document normalization, and PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc652ON7 to b355136 for pure prefix projection. The real-tracker tests are in test/task-recall.test.ts."
  "2026-11-20T07:21:22.507Z",codex-sol,"Round ES typecheck and lint passed. The focused recall, content, native host, and reference command passed 246 cases with zero failures, cancellations, or skips. The final mixed-batch regression passed again after removing the unused fallback for absent SDK row receipts. Changelog regeneration and check passed with both items open. The full coverage command is running on b355136 source."
  "2026-11-20T08:27:04.743Z",codex-sol,"Round ES full quick coverage passed on b355136 source with PM_TEST_FILE_TIMEOUT_MS=3600000, PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick, and PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3. The gate reported 925 passes, zero failures, cancellations, or skips, and 100 percent statements, branches, functions, and lines across 41 source files. The focused reference suite passed 246 tests. Changelog check, typecheck, and lint passed."
  "2026-11-20T09:29:10.750Z",codex-sol,"Round EW on d2f3e42: verify document updates on Tasks, identical and changed body files on verified memories, and receipts and rollback after a real later-row failure."
  "2026-11-20T09:37:10.412Z",codex-sol,"Round EW follows native bulk semantics: record a thrown row as failed, continue the remaining rows, and retain native checkpoints for guarded rollback. Resolve regular body files once in the parser and defer stdin and literal dash handling through the native result service. Recheck memory identity on the current item before preparing verification fields."
  "2026-11-20T09:38:34.721Z",codex-sol,"The three real-tracker regressions failed on d2f3e42 and pass with this change. They cover unchanged regular and stdin body files, literal content, an ordinary Task and a peer retype after parser selection, and a peer deletion after the first bulk row commits. The partial receipt includes both committed rows and its checkpoint restores their original body and verification. Typecheck and lint pass. The focused and full coverage suites are running."
  "2026-11-20T09:39:16.058Z",codex-sol,"Round EW thread mapping: PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc656LYE to 41b8b18 for resolved body-file comparison, PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc656LYJ to 41b8b18 for memory-only verification preparation, and PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc656LYW to 41b8b18 for partial bulk receipts and guarded rollback. The regressions use native tracker writes in test/task-recall.test.ts."
  "2026-11-20T09:47:44.588Z",codex-sol,"A compatibility probe found that the deferred body-file route must retain the CLI join for repeated acceptance criteria and the conversion for the bare regression flag. The literal-file regression now asserts both fields alongside the body and stdin description. The three regressions, typecheck, and lint pass. The focused and full coverage gates restarted on this source."
  "2026-11-20T10:01:46.519Z",codex-sol,"Round EW final thread mapping: PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc656LYE maps to 41b8b18 and a3124ca for resolved body-file comparison and native flag compatibility. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc656LYJ maps to 41b8b18 for memory-only document verification. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc656LYW maps to 41b8b18 for partial bulk receipts and guarded rollback. Typecheck and lint passed. The focused recall, content, and reference suite passed 249 tests in 19 files with zero failures, cancellations, or skips."
  "2026-11-20T10:50:20.835Z",codex-sol,"Origin main advanced to 577d0ed while coverage was running. Merge commit ba98ced combines the shared ranker and preserves single-tracker resume-evidence, federated resume and the federated sharing checks. The federation CLI regression checks that evidence selection stays single-tracker. Typecheck and lint pass on the merged source. The earlier coverage run was superseded and the required commands restarted."
  "2026-11-20T11:18:05.414Z",codex-sol,"On merge ba98ced, the 20 recall and federation tests passed. The expanded focused suite passed 257 tests in 20 files with zero failures, cancellations, or skips. The targeted coverage probe measured 100 percent statements, branches, functions, and lines for both recall modules. The full package coverage gate is still running."
  "2026-11-20T11:23:40.328Z",codex-sol,The merged Node 24 full coverage run marked the existing 1 MiB policy framing test failed and was stopped for a clean retry. The same test passed in an isolated V8-instrumented run. The existing pm-memory-forward-guard-timeout item tracks intermittent failures of this boundary case. The full requested coverage command restarted under Node 26 with the separate suites finished.
  "2026-11-20T12:16:19.135Z",codex-sol,"On merge ba98ced, PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3 npm run coverage passed on Node 26.13.0 with 936 tests, zero failures, cancellations, or skips, and 100 percent statements, branches, functions, and lines across 42 source files. The 1 MiB boundary test passed within the full run."
  "2026-11-20T12:16:25.401Z",codex-sol,"The full changelog was regenerated and changelog:check passed with the item open. The branch contains origin main and the three Round EW findings have real-tracker regression evidence."
  "2026-11-20T15:38:28.616Z",codex-sol,Round FA tracks PR #87 thread PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc65_V8K. Keep the committed update-many receipt and native child rollback references if publishing the combined checkpoint fails. Verify with a real tracker and run the package gates.
  "2026-11-20T15:42:09.095Z",codex-sol,"The real tracker regression reproduced exit 1 with no stdout after both rows committed. Treat combined checkpoint publication as a required dependency and return exit 5 with a distinct checkpoint error, the original row accounting, and durable child checkpoint IDs."
  "2026-11-20T15:42:48.547Z",codex-sol,"Round FA maps PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc65_V8K to cb36625. The fix keeps committed rows and child checkpoint IDs when combined publication fails. The real tracker regression blocks the combined write after the last row commits, then checks each returned checkpoint against its committed history."
  "2026-11-20T15:44:36.061Z",codex-sol,"Typecheck, lint, build, and the focused recall, federation and content run passed with 30 tests. A separate real tracker probe confirmed that direct CLI rollback of a memory child is refused by the verification guard while the existing combined rollback succeeds. Track standalone child recovery in pm-memory-child-checkpoint-rollback."
  "2026-11-20T16:18:54.498Z",codex-sol,The local duplication gate flagged repeated preview setup shared by the two native bulk receipt regressions. Both cases now share one typed CLI preview helper. Package source and assertions about committed rows and checkpoint ownership are unchanged.
  "2026-11-20T17:25:30.135Z",codex-sol,"Round FA verification on the final package source passed. Typecheck, lint, duplication with zero clone pairs, build, 30 focused recall, federation and content tests, and both bulk receipt tests passed. PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3 npm run coverage on Node 26.13.0 passed 937 tests with zero failures, cancellations, or skips and 100 percent statements, branches, functions, and lines across 42 source files. The full run executed the combined-checkpoint publication failure regression after the shared preview helper was extracted. Changelog regeneration and changelog:check passed with this item open."
  "2026-11-20T18:54:08.625Z",codex-sol,"Round FF: add regression fixtures and valid inverses for stdin guidance, combined checkpoint rollback receipts, legacy merge replay, and stale conflict evidence. Keep combined checkpoints as the supported recovery reference."
  "2026-11-20T19:01:57.882Z",codex-sol,"Round FF reproduced the reported failures on the review head with real tracker fixtures. The candidate preserves exact standalone receipt timestamps, checks the proposed target digest under the revision guard, requires current native history for stale reasons, and preserves rollback accounting with a checkpoint error for each failed child. Standalone child rollback remains tracked by pm-memory-child-checkpoint-rollback."
  "2026-11-20T19:05:01.703Z",codex-sol,Round FF thread mapping on pm-memory#87. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc66G62W maps to 4c32e6a for resolving deferred stdin descriptions before verification comparison. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc66G62a maps to 4c32e6a for preserving completed restores and reporting failed child checkpoints. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc66G62f maps to 4c32e6a for preserving legacy version-2 standalone merge timestamps and testing the proposed digest before publication. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc66G62j maps to 4c32e6a for binding stale conflict reasons to current guidance history. PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc66G62o maps to 4c32e6a for withholding standalone child rollback references and testing their refusal. Supported memory recovery requires the combined checkpoint. Standalone child recovery remains open in pm-memory-child-checkpoint-rollback.
  "2026-11-20T20:29:55.565Z",codex-sol,"Round FF verified package source at 4c32e6a on Node 26.13.0. Typecheck, lint and duplication passed. The focused 26-file command passed 313 tests with all six new regressions and the earlier recall, content, native input, native revision and federation fixtures. PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3 npm run coverage passed 943 tests with zero failures, cancellations or skips and 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines across 42 source files. Changelog regeneration and changelog:check passed with the item open."
  "2026-11-20T22:31:58.428Z",codex-sol,"Round FH addresses review thread PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc66LMjO. Bind the merge content clock to the observed target generation, exercise stale corpus data against a newer native document, and rerun the earlier recall and recovery fixtures. Integrate the newer main commit first."
  "2026-11-20T22:33:40.236Z",codex-sol,"Integrated main in f445c61. Its portable guard follow-up history included the branch history as a byte-for-byte prefix, so the merge retained the complete upstream item and history. Before the fix, both new clock regressions failed as expected. The durable intent used the older corpus time instead of the certified future content time and carried the corpus future time even when the certified legacy document used its creation time."
  "2026-11-20T22:34:42.238Z",codex-sol,Round FH maps PRRT_kwDOVPw2oc66LMjO to 0e9394c2b8dbeca5a998780ed64a43c456a0c05d. New intents derive changed_at from the certified target document through memory_changed_at with a created_at fallback. The real-tracker regressions verify the durable target proof and body plus the published content and relationship timestamps with deliberately stale corpus clocks. Existing version-2 receipts keep their recorded timestamp on replay. Typecheck and lint passed.
  "2026-11-20T22:37:44.068Z",codex-sol,"Strict tracker health passes with pm 2026.11.18, including integrity and history drift. The package-local 2026.11.14 executable reports its existing host-version mismatch with pm-github 2026.11.18. The dependency and extension settings are unchanged since the review head. Existing follow-up: pm-memory-ci-health-skew."
  "2026-11-20T23:09:17.857Z",codex-sol,"Round FH focused suite passed all 317 tests in 27 files with no failures, cancellations, or skips. It includes the two stale-clock regressions, Round FF legacy replay across clock skew, and the earlier recall, content, native revision, verification, and guarded recovery fixtures. Checking the additional portable references from the main integration and awaiting full coverage."
  "2026-11-20T23:29:00.893Z",codex-sol,"The four additional focused portable files passed all 25 tests, including the main integration 1 MiB framing case. Changelog regeneration and changelog:check passed with the item open. Full quick coverage remains in progress."
  "2026-11-20T23:51:31.308Z",codex-sol,"Round FH full verification passed on Node 26.13.0. PM_TEST_DEPTH=quick PM_TEST_TIME_SCALE=3 npm run coverage passed 945 tests with zero failures, cancellations, or skips and 100 percent statements, branches, functions, and lines across 42 source files. The 27-file focused command passed 317 tests and the four portable integration references passed 25. Typecheck, lint, and changelog:check passed. The item remains open for orchestration."
  "2026-11-21T02:57:18.014Z",codex-sol,Round FK started at 473d7fa. Reproduce older v2 receipt replay through the CLI and verify how guarded rollback restores freshness evidence. Pair each fixture with its inverse and rerun the earlier regression suites.
  "2026-11-21T03:00:05.862Z",codex-sol,Round FK reproduced both failures on 473d7fa. The CLI refused an intact version-2 receipt at the target clock; the digest-mismatch control retained both endpoint histories. Guarded rollback restored all stored verification fields but recall rejected the previously covered guidance. The inverse fixtures retained unverified for prior stale evidence and for an intervening native guidance edit outside the inverse.
  "2026-11-21T03:06:00.261Z",codex-sol,"Round FK preserves a prepared merge timestamp through the attested CLI host only while the native mutation guard confirms both saved revisions and the exact target digest. The clock-skew fixture passes with both CLI and standalone publication, and the bad digest refuses without changing either endpoint."
  "2026-11-21T03:06:42.347Z",codex-sol,"Round FK restores freshness through native bulk rollback history only when the saved checkpoint traces to covered guidance. The fixtures confirm that earlier unproven guidance, intervening guidance or verification edits, and missing checkpoint context remain unverified. Repeated guarded rollback retains a proven prior state."
